# PortfolioV5 .gitignore
#
# This repo is public. Commit source, docs, research and the small files the
# site serves. Ignore anything a script or tool rebuilds, large local-only
# files, and anything holding secrets or private data.
# Nested rules also live in client/.gitignore and
# blender/xianxia-sect/assets/.gitignore. Git LFS rules are in .gitattributes.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets, private data and per-machine settings
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.*.example
*gcloud.json
.vercel
# Per-machine Claude Code permission lists (.claude/settings.json is shared).
**/.claude/settings.local.json
# IP and SSH port of whichever Vast.ai GPU box is rented right now
# (blender/xianxia-sect/tools/rblender.py).
blender/xianxia-sect/tools/remote*.json
# Personal resume-tailoring skill + its generated outputs (never commit).
# Path-agnostic on purpose: the old client-new/tailored-resumes/ rule stopped
# matching when client-new/ was renamed to client/.
.claude/skills/tailor-resume/
tailored-resumes/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies, build output and tool caches (at any depth)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules
# Next.js build output and TypeScript incremental caches.
# client/.gitignore covers these under client/; these rules catch strays
# elsewhere in the tree (see issue #9).
.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Python: uv virtualenvs, bytecode, pytest and ruff caches.
.venv/
*__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and debug output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
# Playwright MCP debug artifacts (screenshots, snapshots, console logs).
.playwright-mcp/
# Screenshots that browser tools drop at the repo root.
/*.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Blender project (blender/xianxia-sect)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit .blend files: sect_chase.blend is 149 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB
# file limit. Same for Blender's numbered save backups (.blend1) and
# in-progress saves (.blend@).
*.blend
*.blend[0-9]
*.blend@
# Generated output. Everything in out/ is rebuilt by sect/*.py (assemble,
# chase, scenery, bake_web, bake_trees, export_web, preview_*) and
# tools/sect_pack.py, or is a local backup or test render. The rented GPU box
# gets its input from tools/rblender.py uploads, not from git.
blender/xianxia-sect/out/*
# ...except the Seedance prompt plan, which client/docs links to.
!blender/xianxia-sect/out/seedance_prompts.md
# Tree-bake EXR cache (sect/bake_trees.py), about 1 GB.
blender/xianxia-sect/bakecache/
# Third-party downloads in blender/xianxia-sect/assets/ are ignored by that
# folder's own .gitignore; only its CREDITS.md (licences) is committed.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# /sect scene packs (client/public/sect)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# full/ is committed. Its *.glb.gz packs go through Git LFS (.gitattributes);
# the JSON, sky, flyer and detail files beside them are normal files.
# proto/ is the first test set (tools/sect_pack.py --profile proto). It is
# development only: production ignores ?set=proto, and the tests that read it
# skip when it is absent.
client/public/sect/proto/
# Hand-made copies of full/ taken before a repack (an old one was archived on
# 2026-10-21; nothing reads it).
client/public/sect/before/
